          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Features",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Real-time voice-guided app</strong> — speaks and shows each step, then flows to the next at your pace. No lost lines, no buttons between them.</li><li><strong>Convertible easel-box</strong> — packaging that becomes your work surface.</li><li><strong>Wooden phone stand</strong> — holds your guide hands-free while you thread.</li><li><strong>Thread and spool holder</strong> — pre-cut, organized, ready to use.</li><li><strong>Precision threading wand</strong> — designed for clean, accurate placement.</li><li><strong>Numbered paper guide</strong> — a physical reference for using the loom with our app.</li><li><strong>Patented software and loom design</strong> — U.S. Patent 12,423,349. An original system you won't find anywhere else.</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
