          "settings": {
            "title": "Specs",
            "content": "<p><strong>Loom</strong></p><ul><li>Diameter: 20\"</li><li>Patent-pending loom design</li><li>Interlocking modular pieces</li><li>Tool-free</li><li>Easel- or wall-mounted</li></ul><p><strong>Thread</strong></p><ul><li>Pre-cut thread set</li><li>Integrated spool holder included</li></ul><p><strong>Tools included</strong></p><ul><li>Precision threading wand</li><li>Numbered paper guide</li><li>Wooden phone stand</li></ul><p><strong>Packaging</strong></p><ul><li>Mailbox-sized box converts to easel work surface</li><li>No additional stand required</li></ul><p><strong>App</strong></p><ul><li>iOS and Android</li><li>Cost: Free (included with kit)</li><li>Features: photo upload, real-time voice-guided session, adjustable pacing, design preview</li><li>U.S. Patent 12,423,349</li></ul><p><strong>Project duration</strong></p><ul><li>Estimated completion: 5–8 hours depending on design complexity</li><li>Session flexibility: pause and resume — the app saves your progress</li></ul>",
